{"id":"diagram-revision-a849b15f-57a6-426b-92dc-62e17d22034e","diagramId":"diagram-5d2bc009-df74-4f64-a3d4-75d756b9582f","parentId":"diagram-revision-29099275-5376-4073-a946-fe5219b468af","diagram":{"id":"overview","revision":1,"diagramId":"diagram-5d2bc009-df74-4f64-a3d4-75d756b9582f","revisionId":"diagram-revision-a849b15f-57a6-426b-92dc-62e17d22034e","content":{"revisionId":"overview:1","ascii":"Saved CanvasViews and branching\n|\n+-- Saved view = named canvas state with checkpoint history\n|   +-- startCheckpointId -> first saved checkpoint\n|   +-- checkpointIds -> retained checkpoints in order\n|   +-- finalCheckpointId -> latest saved checkpoint\n|   |   +-- Canvas composition: diagrams, layout, connections, presentation\n|   |   +-- Diagram bindings -> exact diagram revisions\n|   |   +-- Saved view state, including camera\n|   |   `-- Existing checkpoints remain immutable\n|   `-- activeViewId -> the view currently being edited\n|\n+-- Capture and save\n|   +-- CREATE(name) -> save the current canvas immediately; make it active\n|   +-- EDIT -> current canvas can differ from the saved endpoint\n|   |   `-- Dirty indicator ignores camera and selection-only changes\n|   `-- SAVE / Ctrl+S -> update the active view's saved endpoint\n|       +-- Retain earlier checkpoints; append current checkpoint if new\n|       `-- Clear that view's stashed working copy\n|\n+-- Switch views without losing work\n|   +-- OPEN(target) -> stash the outgoing active view's current state\n|   |   `-- workingCopies[viewId] -> checkpoint containing unsaved edits\n|   +-- Resume target's working copy if present\n|   |   `-- Otherwise restore target's latest saved checkpoint\n|   +-- Keep the current camera in place while switching\n|   `-- Reopening preserves edits; SAVE makes them the saved endpoint\n|\n+-- Branch from a saved checkpoint\n|   +-- FORK(parent, name) -> create and open one independent child\n|   +-- ALTERNATIVES(parent, names) -> create grouped independent children\n|   |   +-- All children start from ONE pinned parent checkpoint\n|   |   `-- Current canvas stays open; this command only creates copies\n|   +-- Each child records its ancestry\n|   |   +-- parentViewId -> parent view\n|   |   +-- forkCheckpointId -> exact parent checkpoint used\n|   |   `-- alternativeGroupId -> sibling alternatives, when grouped\n|   `-- Unsaved parent edits are excluded: save first to include them\n|\n`-- Choose which branches to retain\n    +-- KEEP(candidate) -> user chooses an alternative\n    |   +-- Open/resume it if needed, then save it\n    |   +-- Archive its group siblings and their descendants\n    |   `-- Retain the chosen candidate and its descendants\n    +-- DISCARD(view) -> archive that view and its descendants\n    |   `-- If active branch is archived: open its available parent,\n    |       or clear the active view when no parent is available\n    `-- Archived views leave the explorer; saved history remains retained","asciiSha256":"92702a5571d95ab26fee901c9d418464d0ebe1e97aeb80ff7c9749dc48e2369f","structure":{"kind":"tree","parserVersion":"ascii-tree-2","rootIds":["overview:1:92702a5571d95ab26fee901c9d418464d0ebe1e97aeb80ff7c9749dc48e2369f:line-1"],"nodes":{"overview:1:92702a5571d95ab26fee901c9d418464d0ebe1e97aeb80ff7c9749dc48e2369f:line-1":{"id":"overview:1:92702a5571d95ab26fee901c9d418464d0ebe1e97aeb80ff7c9749dc48e2369f:line-1","label":"Saved CanvasViews and branching","line":1,"branchColumn":-1,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":31,"childIds":["overview:1:92702a5571d95ab26fee901c9d418464d0ebe1e97aeb80ff7c9749dc48e2369f:line-3","overview:1:92702a5571d95ab26fee901c9d418464d0ebe1e97aeb80ff7c9749dc48e2369f:line-13","overview:1:92702a5571d95ab26fee901c9d418464d0ebe1e97aeb80ff7c9749dc48e2369f:line-21","overview:1:92702a5571d95ab26fee901c9d418464d0ebe1e97aeb80ff7c9749dc48e2369f:line-29","overview:1:92702a5571d95ab26fee901c9d418464d0ebe1e97aeb80ff7c9749dc48e2369f:line-40"],"foldRanges":[{"startLine":2,"endLine":48}]},"overview:1:92702a5571d95